## 3. Platform Services

Serplora Academy provides an online learning platform that includes:

- **Coding Courses and Tutorials** — Structured learning content covering programming languages, frameworks, and computer science concepts
- **Live Coding Compiler** — An in-browser code editor and execution environment for practice and experimentation
- **Quizzes and Assessments** — Interactive evaluations to test and reinforce your learning
- **Community and Forums** — Spaces for users to post questions, share knowledge, and collaborate with other learners

Availability of specific features may vary depending on your plan tier (see Section 4).

