## 4. Free and Paid Plans

### 4.1 Free Plan

Serplora Academy offers a free tier that provides access to a defined set of courses, compiler usage, and community features at no cost. Free plan access may be subject to usage limits, feature restrictions, or the display of advertisements.

### 4.2 Paid Plans

We offer one or more paid subscription plans that provide access to additional or premium features, including but not limited to advanced courses, extended compiler usage, ad-free experience, or priority support.

### 4.3 Plan Changes

We reserve the right to modify the features included in any plan tier, introduce new tiers, or discontinue existing tiers at any time. We will provide reasonable advance notice of material changes to paid plan features.

