## 5. Payments, Billing, and Refunds

### 5.1 Billing

Paid subscriptions are billed on a recurring basis (monthly or annually, as selected at checkout). By subscribing, you authorize us or our payment processor to charge your payment method automatically at each renewal period.

### 5.2 Payment Processing

Payments are processed by third-party payment processors. We do not store your full payment card details on our servers. Your payment information is governed by the privacy policy of the applicable payment processor.

### 5.3 Price Changes

We reserve the right to change subscription pricing at any time. If we change pricing for your current plan, we will notify you at least 30 days in advance. Your continued use of the paid plan after the price change takes effect constitutes your acceptance of the new pricing.

### 5.4 Cancellation

You may cancel your paid subscription at any time through your account settings or by contacting contact@serplora.com. Cancellation takes effect at the end of the current billing period. You will retain access to paid features until the end of your paid period.

### 5.5 Refunds

All payments are **non-refundable** except where required by applicable law. If you believe you have been charged in error, contact us at contact@serplora.com within 14 days of the charge. We will review such requests on a case-by-case basis.

### 5.6 Taxes

You are responsible for all applicable taxes associated with your subscription, except for taxes based on Serplora Academy's net income.

